X:210
T:Stars and Stripes Forever (D/G), piccolo obbligato
T:(Be Kind to Your Web-Footed Friends)
C:John Philip Sousa, lyrics by Fred Allen
C:transposed for the SPUDS contra dance arrangement
N:Arrangement by Jo Anne Rocke; edited by Adlai Waksman
N:(checked against SPUDS chords)
Z:B Quern & S Gowan; piccolo A Waksman
%%partsbox true
%%printtempo false
%%staffsep .75in
Q:1/2=120
L:1/4
M:C|
%P:C
V:1 clef=treble+8 name=Piccolo
% (Flutists prefer leger lines to 8va's.)
%       For concertina.net, use   %%MIDI transpose 12
%       to transpose the piccolo part up an octave.
